{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_3202_036kan", "source_sha256": "eba02dabe3ef550d0134a13f520d5a849bdd53c118f83c22e43a4fcfeebff9d3", "ja": "私達の～新しい～歌～♪　みんな聴いてね～♪\n新しい～歌を～♪　えへへ♪", "zh": "我们的～新～歌～♪大家要听喔～♪\n新～歌～♪嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_3300_p", "source_sha256": "a69f55ca7a44196df1b26aa7afc62030cbc7f453fcb64c56bd8a0a4bbe9637d0", "ja": "ミュージカルっぽく、今の気持ちを歌って\n新曲をPRしたらどうかな？", "zh": "用音乐剧风格唱出现在的心情，\n来为新歌做宣传怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
