{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_3502_036kan", "source_sha256": "ff340e8be92f1c0da1b29e112a2686cbc52e062d0b99a6a321f544309286a330", "ja": "はれ？　{$P$}さん、私って\nもしかして……ラップスターの才能ありませんか！？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}先生，我该不会……\n有成为饶舌巨星的潜力！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
